 "insight": [
  "In 2025, Luxembourg imported the most pharmaceutical products from Belgium, Germany, and the Netherlands.",
  "The total imports amounted to 834.2 million euros, with Belgium alone accounting for 705.6 million euros or 84.6% of the total.",
  "Germany and the Netherlands followed with 46.9 million euros and 31.5 million euros respectively.",
  "The top three countries together made up 94.0% of Luxembourg's pharmaceutical imports.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
